ind\":\"cli-opencode\",\"executable\":\"opencode\",\"executableVersion\":\"sha256:9f3147cae4ca323827d3ca39451b0d3431b2906e79a08e9b09d1eb34bb703f52\",\"model\":\"opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash\",\"reasoningEffort\":\"max\",\"serviceTier\":null,\"sandboxMode\":\"danger-full-access\",\"permissionMode\":\"acceptEdits\",\"webSearch\":\"inherit\"},\"invocationFingerprint\":\"inv:12594d2d70b70d8c3d6caf8bce7a53c3124f7b7ea78b8cbaabe65606f6a14994\"}\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"    2075 review-brief-8.txt\na command is looked up. attach-docs covers the matcher comment and suffix tests and this branch's net change to CONTRIBUTING.md against origin/main, a /create:skill to /create:sk-skill rename; check each command it names exists under .skilled/commands. Do not re-report these recorded limits unless you show a new input that breaks them: a suffix followed by a file extension such as :auto.md reads as the command, as it did before this branch; a node -e arrow inside escaped quotes still reads as a redirect; isolation-check.sh is macOS only. Every finding is P0, P1 or P2 with file:line and a concrete input that shows it. HOLDOUT RULE: never open command-prompts.jsonl, holdout-prompts.jsonl or behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl except through jq 'del(.prompt)', never run git diff, show or log -p over a path that includes them without the pathspecs ':(exclude)**/command-prompts.jsonl' ':(exclude)**/holdout-prompts.jsonl' ':(exclude)**/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl', never run score-command-transcripts.mjs --summary, and never print session text from a CLI session store. Never read or create .skilled/hooks/hook-flags.env. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder.\n\n--- steer ---\nno steer.md yet\n--- invocation ---\n{\"effectiveConfig\":{\"kind\":\"cli-opencode\",\"executable\":\"opencode\",\"executableVersion\":\"sha256:9f3147cae4ca323827d3ca39451b0d3431b2906e79a08e9b09d1eb34bb703f52\",\"model\":\"opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash\",\"reasoningEffort\":\"max\",\"serviceTier\":null,\"sandboxMode\":\"danger-full-access\",\"permissionMode\":\"acceptEdits\",\"webSearch\":\"inherit\"},\"invocationFingerprint\":\"inv:12594d2d70b70d8c3d6caf8bce7a53c3124f7b7ea78b8cbaabe65606f6a14994\"}\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review && wc -c review-brief-8.txt && tail -c 1200 review-brief-8.txt; echo; echo \\\"--- steer ---\\\"; ls -la lineages/scorer-8/steer.md 2>/dev/null || echo \\\"no steer.md yet\\\"; echo \\\"--- invocation ---\\\"; cat lineages/scorer-8/invocation-metadata.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1794832892357,"end":1794832892858}}}}
