{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794833096289,"sessionID":"ses_e1b9f9c06ffemmJMnzkzBHTwnQ","part":{"partID":"prt_1e463968d001C4AER2gySbkZjQ","sessionID":"ses_e1b9f9c06ffemmJMnzkzBHTwnQ","messageID":"msg_1e4638886001bnXw8NEigqMzCD","type":"tool","id":"call_58c6758193bc4c469ca29773","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json,re\nd=json.load(open('deep-review-findings-registry.json'))\npat=re.compile(r'mode suffix|MODE_SUFFIX|autopilot|unattended|with-research|with-phases|with-context|tilde|guarded|unsafe|selfAuto|:auto', re.I)\nfor f in d['openFindings']+d['resolvedFindings']:\n    blob=' '.join(str(f.get(k,'')) for k in ['findingId','title','file'])\n    if pat.search(blob):\n        print(f['findingId'],'|',f['severity'],'|',f['status'],'|',f['file'],'|',f['title'])\nEOF"},"output":"iter1-P2-mode-suffix-hides-repeat | P2 | active | .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs | A mode suffix hides a command reported twice\nR4-P2-001--d1528b81a2ca | P2 | active | .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts | COMMAND_POLICIES is generated, drift-guarded and documented as the attach-path policy lookup, but no code reads it\niter1-P1-shell-writes-invisible | P1 | active | .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs | In-place shell edits are never write events, so unsafe and loopInit miss every write that is not a redirect\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"iter1-P2-mode-suffix-hides-repeat | P2 | active | .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs | A mode suffix hides a command reported twice\nR4-P2-001--d1528b81a2ca | P2 | active | .skilled/skills/syste