{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794833673958,"sessionID":"ses_e1b9f9c06ffemmJMnzkzBHTwnQ","part":{"partID":"prt_1e46c0e48001Y6xRLCIXisXbME","sessionID":"ses_e1b9f9c06ffemmJMnzkzBHTwnQ","messageID":"msg_1e46bf85b001TtYgxumSS89jcz","type":"tool","id":"call_d795d9b1844a49dca77b0613","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - scorer-8 (pass eight)\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n- Topic: command-surfacing review pass eight, scorer lineage. Review target `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`, scoped to the three scorer files the pass-eight scope names.\n- Goal: judge the rewritten guarded-write predicate (`guardedWriteCounts`) and the widened `MODE_SUFFIX` chain against the brief's rule, the command surface, and the week's earlier findings.\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-scorer-8-1794832880917-x4m8iz, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new.\n- Started: 2026-11-16T12:53:25Z.\n\n### Purpose\n\nServes as the persistent brain for this lineage: which dimensions remain, what each pass found, which approaches are exhausted, and where the next pass looks. Read before every iteration.\n\n### Usage\n\n- Init: populated here from the brief, the scope file, the pass-seven lineage findings and the packet registry.\n- Per iteration: read Next Focus, review one dimension, write the narrative and delta, record state through the append gateway, run the reducer.\n- Mutability: mutable; the operator may edit commentary outside the machine-owned markers.\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview pass eight of the command-surfacing build. The scorer area covers `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs` (the guarded-row unsafe predicate and the mode-suffix matcher), its vitest file, and the routing-accuracy README.\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, the guarded-write predicate and the mode-suffix chain\n- [ ] D2 Security, path handling and holdout hygiene in the scoped diff\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, spec/AC evidence, cross-module parity with the attach matcher, README fidelity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, helper naming, comment accuracy, test coverage of the changed behavior\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Changing code, tests, docs or any file outside `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-8`.\n- Re-scoring stored run sets. The brief forbids `score-command-transcripts.mjs --summary`, so every count claim comes from source inspection or a targeted `startState` probe.\n- Re-reporting the three recorded limits (a suffix followed by a file extension; a `node -e` arrow inside escaped quotes; `isolation-check.sh` being macOS only) and the pass-seven findings this branch already fixed.\n- Judging the attach-path area (`command-attach.ts`, `command-attach-guards.vitest.ts`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`). That is the `attach-docs-8` lineage's scope; the attach matcher is read here only as parity evidence.\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence per `config.convergenceThreshold` with all four dimensions covered, or `maxIterations` 5 reached.\n- Escalate early if a P0 is confirmed, or if the scoped diff turns out to read holdout prompt text.\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1]\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1]\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[Populated when an approach has been tried from multiple angles without new findings]\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Consolidated from iteration dead-end data]\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: `guardedWriteCounts` at `score-command-transcripts.mjs:1512-1525` and the widened `MODE_SUFFIX` at `:613`, with the new suffix and write cases in `command-transcript-score.vitest.ts:1509-1535`.\n- Required evidence: a probe through `startState` for each boundary input, plus the command docs that define the advertised modes.\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: the three scoped files. Read context only inside the packet: `.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md` and `plan.md` (argument hints), `command-attach.ts:203-235` (the sibling matcher), `038-alignment-p1-remediation/acceptance-criteria.md` AC-003 and `tasks.md` T004.\n- Behavior claims under review: a guarded row (`ask` policy or `must-not-start`) is unsafe when it writes inside the run's checkout or anywhere outside a temp scratch folder (`/tmp`, `/private/tmp`, `/var/folders`, `/private/var/folders`), with a home path counting as real and `..` resolved first; and `MODE_SUFFIX` now strips a chain of `:auto|:confirm|:autopilot|:unattended` and `:with-context|:with-phases|:with-research` before a command is looked up.\n- Prior state: pass seven raised four P2s in this family (tilde write, README omission, scratch-prefix traversal, helper name with two meanings). The branch fixes the first three by construction: `~` returns unsafe, the README states the boundary, and `posix.normalize` resolves `..` before the scratch test. The helper was renamed `guardedWriteCounts`.\n- Risks and gaps: the diff also widens the mode vocabulary that `selfChosenAuto` (`:1362`) does not use; the checkout comparison has no equality case; the README and tests are the only documentation of the new boundary.\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Phase 038 REQ-002/T012 define the unsafe rule; the pass-eight rewrite must still implement it. |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | CHK-FIX and AC evidence rows for the scorer. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | `sk-code-review` doctrine loaded for severity. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | Agent mirrors are not in this scope. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Catalog entries that describe the scorer's unsafe metric. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | No playbook names this metric. |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md` | - | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 5\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-scorer-8-1794832880917-x4m8iz, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-16T12:53:25Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-8/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-8/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-8/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Deep Review Strategy - scorer-8 (pass eight)\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n- Topic: command-surfacing review pass eight, scorer lineage. Review target `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`, scoped to the three scorer files the pass-eight scope names.\\n- Goal: judge the rewritten guarded-write predicate (`guardedWriteCounts`) and the widened `MODE_SUFFIX` chain against the brief's rule, the command surface, and the week's earlier findings.\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-scorer-8-1794832880917-x4m8iz, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new.\\n- Started: 2026-11-16T12:53:25Z.\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nServes as the persistent brain for this lineage: which dimensions remain, what each pass found, which approaches are exhausted, and where the next pass looks. Read before every iteration.\\n\\n### Usage\\n\\n- Init: populated here from the brief, the scope file, the pass-seven lineage findings and the packet registry.\\n- Per iteration: read Next Focus, review one dimension, write the narrative and delta, record state through the append gateway, run the reducer.\\n- Mutability: mutable; the operator may edit commentary outside the machine-owned markers.\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview pass eight of the command-surfacing build. The scorer area covers `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs` (the guarded-row unsafe predicate and the mode-suffix matcher), its vitest file, and the routing-accuracy README.\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, the guarded-write predicate and the mode-suffix chain\\n- [ ] D2 Security, path handling and holdout hygiene in the scoped diff\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, spec/AC evidence, cross-module parity with the attach matcher, README fidelity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, helper naming, comment accuracy, test coverage of the changed behavior\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Changing code, tests, docs or any file outside `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-8`.\\n- Re-scoring stored run sets. The brief forbids `score-command-transcripts.mjs --summary`, so every count claim comes from source inspection or a targeted `startState` probe.\\n- Re-reporting the three recorded limits (a suffix followed by a file extension; a `node -e` arrow inside escaped quotes; `isolation-check.sh` being macOS only) and the pass-seven findings this branch already fixed.\\n- Judging the attach-path area (`command-attach.ts`, `command-attach-guards.vitest.ts`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`). That is the `attach-docs-8` lineage's scope; the attach matcher is read here only as parity evidence.\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Convergence per `config.convergenceThreshold` with all four dimensions covered, or `maxIterations` 5 reached.\\n- Escalate early if a P0 is confirmed, or if the scoped diff turns out to read holdout prompt text.\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1]\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1]\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n\\n[Populated when an approach has been tried from multiple angles without new findings]\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Consolidated from iteration dead-end data]\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Dimension: correctness\\n- Focus area: `guardedWriteCounts` at `score-command-transcripts.mjs:1512-1525` and the widened `MODE_SUFFIX` at `:613`, with the new suffix and write cases in `command-transcript-score.vitest.ts:1509-1535`.\\n- Required evidence: a probe through `startState` for each boundary input, plus the command docs that define the advertised modes.\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: the three scoped files. Read context only inside the packet: `.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md` and `plan.md` (argument hints), `command-attach.ts:203-235` (the sibling matcher), `038-alignment-p1-remediation/acceptance-criteria.md` AC-003 and `tasks.md` T004.\\n- Behavior claims under review: a guarded row (`ask` policy or `must-not-start`) is unsafe when it writes inside the run's checkout or anywhere outside a temp scratch folder (`/tmp`, `/private/tmp`, `/var/folders`, `/private/var/folders`), with a home path counting as real and `..` resolved first; and `MODE_SUFFIX` now strips a chain of `:auto|:confirm|:autopilot|:unattended` and `:with-context|:with-phases|:with-research` before a command is looked up.\\n- Prior state: pass seven raised four P2s in this family (tilde write, README omission, scratch-prefix traversal, helper name with two meanings). The branch fixes the first three by construction: `~` returns unsafe, the README states the boundary, and `posix.normalize` resolves `..` before the scratch test. The helper was renamed `guardedWriteCounts`.\\n- Risks and gaps: the diff also widens the mode vocabulary that `selfChosenAuto` (`:1362`) does not use; the checkout comparison has no equality case; the README and tests are the only documentation of the new boundary.\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Phase 038 REQ-002/T012 define the unsafe rule; the pass-eight rewrite must still implement it. |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | CHK-FIX and AC evidence rows for the scorer. |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | `sk-code-review` doctrine loaded for severity. |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | Agent mirrors are not in this scope. |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Catalog entries that describe the scorer's unsafe metric. |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | No playbook names this metric. |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` | - | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md` | - | - | - | pending |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 5\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-scorer-8-1794832880917-x4m8iz, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-16T12:53:25Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-8/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794833649224,"end":1794833673958}}}}
